  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Getting used to",
     "texto": [
      "**Привыкнуть к** («to get used to») takes the dative: **привыкнуть к шуму** («to get used to the noise»). In the past, **привык** (masculine) and **привыкла** (feminine): **Я привык к городу** («I got used to the city»).",
      "In the future, **привыкну** («I will get used to»): **Я привыкну** («I will get used to it»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Getting tired of something",
     "texto": [
      "**Надоесть** («to tire», «to bore») takes the person in the dative and the thing that wears them out as the subject: **Мне надоел шум** («I am tired of the noise»). The verb agrees with what wears one out: **надоел** (masculine), **надоела** (feminine), **надоело** (neuter).",
      "To talk about pros and cons, use **с одной стороны... с другой стороны...** («on the one hand... on the other hand»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
